{"2777660": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "RC Overdrive", "steam_appid": 2777660, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RC Overdrive </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 championships </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 race tracks  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 different RC-Cars </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 achievements </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 different levels of AI difficulty &amp; simulation</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><br>Items</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Success in RC Overdrive hinges on strategic item usage, with access to 8 unique items such as drones with bombs, oil spills, turbo boosts, and others, all aimed at securing your first-place position through tactical maneuvers during races.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2777660/extras/b05b086204035adf4edad04cf7404972.avif?t=1771792893\" width=1272 height=722 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cars</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock 10 RC carsand use their performance characteristics such as acceleration, suspension types and tire grip to get the best performance for each track. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2777660/extras/d391db59ffa508ec4cb768c49b40f121.avif?t=1771792893\" width=1256 height=688 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tracks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a track master by maintaining high speeds without flipping your car as you navigate through diverse environments including malls, suburban streets, miniature worlds, museums, RC tracks, and beyond.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2777660/extras/f2f14e6f634c2fe4050e154305eab7ce.avif?t=1771792893\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2777660/extras_big/f2f14e6f634c2fe4050e154305eab7ce.webp?t=1771792893 width=1560 height=879 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Championships</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race through two championships, aiming to finish at least third place in each race to earn money for new cars and unlock more challenging races and championships. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2777660/extras/fd63cff483241dd4cddb52c7c05554d6.avif?t=1771792893\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RC Overdrive </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 championships </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 race tracks  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 different RC-Cars </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 achievements </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 different levels of AI difficulty &amp; simulation</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><br>Items</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Success in RC Overdrive hinges on strategic item usage, with access to 8 unique items such as drones with bombs, oil spills, turbo boosts, and others, all aimed at securing your first-place position through tactical maneuvers during races.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2777660/extras/b05b086204035adf4edad04cf7404972.avif?t=1771792893\" width=1272 height=722 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cars</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock 10 RC carsand use their performance characteristics such as acceleration, suspension types and tire grip to get the best performance for each track. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\